SUMMARY:🚶‍♂️(NEW) Walk: New Market Go Station to Aurora Go Statio
 n Trail!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🚶‍♂️(NEW) Fall Walk: Ne
 w Market Go Station to Aurora Go Station Trail!🚶‍♂️\n\nWe’re tr
 ying something new! Join us for a **beautiful 10 km fall walk** (about 3 h
 ours plus a break) as we make our way from **New Market GO Station to Auro
 ra GO Station**. Along the way\, we’ll pass through tree-filled areas\, 
 Fairy Lake\, Wesley Brooks Conservation Area\, scenic walking paths\, and 
 peaceful waterways. With colourful fall foliage all around\, this will be 
 one of the most stunning walks of the season!\n\n***\n\n## 🚆 How We’r
 e Getting There: GO Train\n\n* **Cost:** $10 Weekend Day Pass → Buy here
 \n(Buy after **August 13th** – valid for 10 days. Do *not* activate unti
 l we all meet up. This is cheaper than Presto or senior fares. Online only
 .)\n* **Route:** Union Station → New Market GO Station (we are on the Ba
 rrie Line heading towards **Allandale Waterfront**).\n\n***\n\n## ⏰ Meet
 up Details\n\n* **Meetup Time:** 9:30AM (we’ll wait until 9:45 AM before
  walking over to Union Station).\n* **Meetup Spot:** Outside the **Fairmon
 t Royal York Hotel** – look for me wearing my Moose Hat 🦌.\n* **Train
  Leaves:** 10:01 AM sharp.\n* **Arrival at New Market GO Station:** 1100 A
 M.\n\n***\n\n## 🚌 Return Train Options\n\n* 1:55 PM – our target retu
 rn train.\n* 2:55 PM – in case we miss the first one.\n\n***\n\n## 🚗 
 Driving Option\n\nIf you’d rather drive:\n\n* Meet us at **New Market GO
  Station** at **11:00 AM.**\n* We will leave promptly at **11:10 AM** – 
 please be on time!\n* You will be responsible for getting back to your par
 king spot.\n* We will not me walking back.\n\n***\n\n## 💲 Fees\n\n* **M
 eetup Fee:** $5 cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.co
 m**\n* **GO Train Day Pass:** $10[ (CLICK HERE)](https://www.gotransit.com
 /en/partners-and-promotions/weekend-passes-with-go)\n\n***\n\n## 📌 What
  to Bring\n\n* Water\n* Good walking shoes\n* A snack or light lunch\n* We
 ather-appropriate clothing (it’s fall – layers are your friend!)\n\n**
 *\n\n## 💬 Final Notes\n\nThis group is open to everyone – singles\, c
 ouples\, or just those wanting to meet new friends. We also host movies\, 
 hikes\, arts & culture outings\, restaurants\, and more.\n\n* You can just
  **show up on the day of** if you’re not sure in advance – just please
  be on time!\n* Sometimes things happen and I may need to cancel\, so keep
  an eye out for updates.\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here 
 to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n📧 Questio
 ns? Email me at **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com** or post on the Mee
 tup wall.
