SUMMARY:Waterfront Walk to Sunnyside Beach! 9KM
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n### 🌊 Waterfront Walk to Sunnys
 ide Beach\n\nLooking for a relaxing way to enjoy the city?\nJoin us for a 
 scenic walk along Toronto’s beautiful waterfront as we make our way to *
 *Sunnyside Beach** — one of the oldest and most charming beaches in the 
 city!\n\nThis is a **flat\, beginner-friendly walk**\, perfect for anyone 
 wanting to stretch their legs\, meet new people\, and soak up some lakesid
 e vibes.\n\nJust be prepared to keep pace with the group — we walk at a 
 steady but social speed!\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here 
 to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n### 
 📍 Meetup Details:\n\n**Meetup Time:** 11:00am\n⏳ *We’ll wait 5 minu
 tes before heading out.*\n**Meetup Location:** In front of the **BeaverTai
 ls Red Building** by the waterfront. Look for **Mathew in his signature Mo
 ose Hat** — you can’t miss it!\n\n**End Point:** **Sunnyside Beach**\,
  where we’ll stop to rest\, snack\, chat\, and enjoy the waterfront.\n\n
 ***\n\n### 💵 Meetup Fee:\n\n**$5 cash in person** or **E-transfer** to:
 \n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n(*This helps support the group and k
 eeps events going!*)\n\n***\n\n### 🧺 What to Expect:\n\n*\n* A fun and 
 social waterfront walk from the Harbourfront to Sunnyside Beach\n* Time to
  relax by the water\, have lunch\, and hang out\n* Bring **something small
  to share** (cookies\, fruit\, trail mix\, etc.)\n* Stay as long or as lit
 tle as you like – your schedule\, your pace!\n\n***\n\n### 🧳 What to 
 Bring:\n\n✅ Water\n✅ Comfortable walking shoes\n✅ A snack and **some
 thing to share**\n✅ Sunscreen or a hat (optional but recommended)\n\n***
 \n\n### ✅ A Few Reminders:\n\n* You’re welcome to just **show up day-o
 f**\, even if you haven’t RSVPed.\n* This group is for **anyone looking 
